    "description": "Rise as Werewolf. An addon for Vampirism",
    "body": "# Werewolves\n\n![](https://i.ibb.co/ZVCYD1k/werewolves-title.png)\n\n## Mod Description\n\nAs werewolf you rule the night and bring fear to the people.\n\nInstead of becoming a hunter or vampire you can get bitten by a werewolf to be cursed as werewolf.  This allows you transform into beast forms.\n\n## Dependencies\n \nThis is an addon mod for ![](https://modrinth.com/mod/vampirism) adding a new faction\n\n### Incompatibilities\n\n- When Epic Fight Mod is installed the werewolf form is not shown\n\n\n## Development\n\nThis mod is Open Source. The code can be found on GitHub under LGPL-3 license\n\nIt is actively developed by cheaterpaul as much as spare time permits.",
